.SH Requirements
.IP \[bu] 2
\f[CR]tmux\f[R] on \f[CR]$PATH\f[R], and hed running inside a tmux
session.
.IP \[bu] 2
The \f[CR]tmux\f[R] plugin loaded (this plugin depends on its
\f[CR]tmux_pane_*\f[R] API).
.IP \[bu] 2
Your configured AI shell CLI on \f[CR]$PATH\f[R].
Without it, the pane opens and immediately exits.
.SH Notes
.IP \[bu] 2
The pane is named \f[CR]aishell\f[R] in tmux\[cq]s pane registry, so
\f[CR]:tmux_toggle\f[R] (the runner pane) and \f[CR]:aishell_toggle\f[R]
are independent \[em] you can keep both around at once.
.IP \[bu] 2
\f[CR]:aishell_send\f[R] is a thin wrapper around
\f[CR]tmux send\-keys\f[R].
Anything that works at your AI shell prompt works here.
